# Finding the player's position with the scanner (NX_PROBE_SCAN=<out.txt>; docs/PLAY-TOOLS.md, "Finding the player").
# Put after the menus (tools/play/routes/menus-course11.frames) behind "@course+30": the player stands at the start.
# Walk right, stand, walk left, stand, walk right: x goes up, stays, goes down, stays, goes up. Each "same" check
# waits 60 frames after the walk, so the player (and the camera following it) has stopped.
0:SNAP
20:RIGHT:40
120:KEEP:inc
120:SNAP
180:KEEP:same
180:SNAP
185:LEFT:30
280:KEEP:dec
280:SNAP
340:KEEP:same
340:SNAP
345:RIGHT:30
440:KEEP:inc
441:DUMP
445:MARK:end
